Devtize is a local-first developer command layer

Usage:
  dvz [command]

Available Commands:
  commit      Create a verified commit from disclosed changed paths
  doctor      Inspect local Devtize readiness without making changes
  find        Find reviewed command knowledge without executing it
  help        Help about any command
  repo        Plan and run the Phase B repository self-hosting workflow
  ship        Push reviewed local commits without force
  version     Show Devtize build information

Flags:
  -h, --help       help for dvz
      --json       emit versioned JSON output
      --no-color   disable colored output

Use "dvz [command] --help" for more information about a command.
